    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge Maestro is a combo-driven puzzle-like rogue-like. Merge Emoji themed Tokens together to create more powerful Tokens to defeat waves of enemies. Craft your set with<strong>\u00a0Hundreds</strong> of unique Tokens to create<strong>\u00a0Thousands</strong> of powerful and wacky combinations. No two runs are ever the same in this bite sized rogue-like you can take with you anywhere!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place </strong>Tokens on  on the board and\u00a0<strong>Merge</strong>\u00a0tokens of the same type to make ones of a higher Level. Higher Level Tokens are Stronger!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/49646142dc24cb11b38cd967500776f0.poster.avif?t=1755564001\" width=608 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/49646142dc24cb11b38cd967500776f0.webm?t=1755564001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/49646142dc24cb11b38cd967500776f0.mp4?t=1755564001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose</strong>\u00a0a new Token to add to your set at the end of every wave. There are 100's of Tokens to discover each with unique effects!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/a5fa913cd3221a94813251e6ec63b87e.poster.avif?t=1755564001\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/a5fa913cd3221a94813251e6ec63b87e.webm?t=1755564001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/a5fa913cd3221a94813251e6ec63b87e.mp4?t=1755564001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synergize</strong> your build to defeat the ever more challenging enemies that come each wave across multiple difficulties and challenges!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/5dc87c23020165a2f73cef0d2483f6d5.poster.avif?t=1755564001\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/5dc87c23020165a2f73cef0d2483f6d5.webm?t=1755564001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/5dc87c23020165a2f73cef0d2483f6d5.mp4?t=1755564001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain</strong>\u00a0crazy Powers throughout each run, each with game changing, potentially even game breaking effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/6da21d80197091f8868a46c39249bdaa.poster.avif?t=1755564001\" width=608 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/6da21d80197091f8868a46c39249bdaa.webm?t=1755564001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/6da21d80197091f8868a46c39249bdaa.mp4?t=1755564001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ Unique Emoji based Tokens to be discovered with their own special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Game-changing Powers to experiment with, each completely changing the mechanics of a run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 themed packs of Tokens that get more complex and wacky</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Difficulty modes that progressively force you to learn and adapt to ever more cunning enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Challenges that completely change the way the game is played</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Strategies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Construct a city to whittle down your enemies turn by turn</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Become a chef and combine foods, fruit and drinks to turn your tokens super!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Destroy your own tokens and create a relentless resurrecting army of the dead</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And<strong> much, much</strong> <strong><u>more</u></strong>!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/4941f33672e9081a45f6668437a7b4e0.poster.avif?t=1755564001\" width=608 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/4941f33672e9081a45f6668437a7b4e0.webm?t=1755564001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/4941f33672e9081a45f6668437a7b4e0.mp4?t=1755564001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join The Community!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/f08d06793d056ee3d8f140b426ad0912.avif?t=1755564001\" width=608 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Discord channel for announcements and to give any feedback, suggestions or post any bugs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge Maestro is a combo-driven puzzle-like rogue-like. Merge Emoji themed Tokens together to create more powerful Tokens to defeat waves of enemies. Craft your set with<strong>\u00a0Hundreds</strong> of unique Tokens to create<strong>\u00a0Thousands</strong> of powerful and wacky combinations. No two runs are ever the same in this bite sized rogue-like you can take with you anywhere!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place </strong>Tokens on  on the board and\u00a0<strong>Merge</strong>\u00a0tokens of the same type to make ones of a higher Level. Higher Level Tokens are Stronger!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/49646142dc24cb11b38cd967500776f0.poster.avif?t=1755564001\" width=608 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/49646142dc24cb11b38cd967500776f0.webm?t=1755564001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/49646142dc24cb11b38cd967500776f0.mp4?t=1755564001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose</strong>\u00a0a new Token to add to your set at the end of every wave. There are 100's of Tokens to discover each with unique effects!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/a5fa913cd3221a94813251e6ec63b87e.poster.avif?t=1755564001\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/a5fa913cd32