 class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ Unique Emoji based Tokens to be discovered with their own special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Game-changing Powers to experiment with, each completely changing the mechanics of a run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 themed packs of Tokens that get more complex and wacky</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Difficulty modes that progressively force you to learn and adapt to ever more cunning enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Challenges that completely change the way the game is played</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Strategies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Construct a city to whittle down your enemies turn by turn</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Become a chef and combine foods, fruit and drinks to turn your tokens super!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Destroy your own tokens and create a relentless resurrecting army of the dead</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And<strong> much, much</strong> <strong><u>more</u></strong>!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/4941f33672e9081a45f6668437a7b4e0.poster.avif?t=1755564001\" width=608 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/4941f33672e9081a45f6668437a7b4e0.webm?t=1755564001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/4941f33672e9081a45f6668437a7b4e0.mp4?t=1755564001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join The Community!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/f08d06793d056ee3d